╭─ Help ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│Move (NORMAL)                                           Find, search, react                                           │
│  j/↓         move down (newer)                           /           search messages in this workspace               │
│  k/↑         move up (older; loads history at the top)   r           react to the selected message                   │
│  g           go to the top                               ↓/C-n       next (j too in search results)                  │
│  G           go to the newest                            ↑/C-p       previous (k too in search results)              │
│  h/←         pane to the left                            Enter       pick                                            │
│  l/→         pane to the right                                                                                       │
│  Tab         next pane                                 Messages (NORMAL)                                             │
│  S-Tab       previous pane                               e           edit your message                               │
│                                                          D           delete your message (asks y/n)                  │
│Conversations                                             R           reply in the message's thread                   │
│  Enter       open conversation / thread of message                                                                   │
│  1–9         switch workspace                          Autocomplete (INSERT)                                         │
│  C-k/C-t     find a conversation in any workspace        @ # :       suggest people, channels, emoji                 │
│  C-b         show or hide the sidebar                    Tab/Enter   pick the suggestion (Esc closes)                │
│  <           narrower sidebar                            ↓/C-n       next suggestion                                 │
│  >           wider sidebar                               ↑/C-p       previous suggestion                             │
│  C-r         renew an expired desktop session                                                                        │
│                                                        Commands (COMMAND)                                            │
│Modes                                                     :q              quit                                        │
│  i           write a message (INSERT)                    :open <name>    open a conversation by name (#general, @ana)│
│  :           command line (COMMAND)                      :help           this help                                   │
│  Esc         back to NORMAL / close the thread           :attach <path>  send a file here; any text after it is the …│
│  ?           this help                                   :search <query> search messages in this workspace           │
│  q           quit                                        :react <emoji>  react to the selected message (:react +1)   │
│                                                          :away / :back   set your presence to away / automatic       │
│Compose (INSERT)                                          :dnd <length>   do not disturb: 30m, 1h, 2h, tomorrow       │
│  Enter       send                                        :dnd off        end do not disturb                          │
│  A-Enter/C-j new line                                                                                                │
│  Esc         back to NORMAL / close the thread                                                                       │
│                                                                                                                      │
│Files                                                                                                                 │
│  o           open the message's file (xdg-open)                                                                      │
│  I           show or hide inline images                                                                              │
│  C-o         attach a file (:attach)                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                      │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
